  "content": "<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamictrees\" rel=\"nofollow\">動態樹木</a>&nbsp;| <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-nouveau\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ars Nouveau</a></h2><h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/910/519/ars_nouveau.webp\" alt=\"header\" width=\"883\" height=\"361\"></h5><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/A4FCBS3\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0Prkr13.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"166\" height=\"32\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>概述</strong></h2><p>此模組使 Ars Nouveau 與動態樹木相容，新增由 Ars Nouveau 添加的秘法樹木之動態生長版本，並在世界生成時完全取代它們。<br>這些樹木的行為與生成方式可透過樹木包進行自訂與調整。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><strong>功能特色</strong></strong></h2><h4><strong>包含的樹木</strong></h4><ul>\n<li>瀑布秘法樹</li>\n<li>繁茂秘法樹</li>\n<li>惱人秘法樹</li>\n<li>熾焰秘法樹</li>\n<li>閃光秘法樹（若安裝<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-elemental\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ars Elemental</a>）</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><strong>世界生成&nbsp;</strong></h4><p>所有秘法樹木在森林生態域中生成機率極低，你需要展開一段探險才能找到它們</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><strong>開發中功能</strong></h4><p>動態秘法樹木<strong>目前尚不支援</strong>覺醒碑石，請暫時使用普通版本（將樹莢與水桶合成以獲得樹苗）</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><strong>其他擴充模組</strong></strong></h2><p>適用於其他模組的動態樹木擴充可在<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamictrees\" rel=\"nofollow\">動態樹木 CurseForge 頁面</a>找到。</p><h4><strong>建議與請求</strong></h4><p>若想請求新增模組相容性，請至此處提交！！&nbsp;<br><a href=\"https://github.com/orgs/DynamicTreesTeam/discussions/categories/compatibility-addon-suggestions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/orgs/DynamicTreesTeam/discussions/categories/compatibility-addon-suggestions</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><strong>需求</strong></strong></h2><p>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamictrees\" rel=\"nofollow\">動態樹木<br></a>-&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-nouveau\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ars Nouveau</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"><strong>授權與模組包</strong></h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p>你可以自由將此模組用於任何模組包！無需詢問。<br>本模組採用<strong>MIT</strong>授權，原始碼公開於 GitHub。</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
